SpectrumOS installer and recovery environment

Run spectrum-hardware-report to collect the laptop acceptance baseline.
The repository payload is available at /usr/local/share/spectrumos/source.
A compatibility link is available at /root/SpectrumOS2.
Use spectrum-snapshot only after identifying the correct target devices.
Choose Rescue system in the installer or press Super+R for a terminal with recovery instructions.
Every new live terminal shows the same guide. Run spectrum-recovery for the interactive recovery menu.
